    {
      "id": "compose-runtime",
      "name": "Compose Runtime",
      "version": "1.9.0-beta02",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/compose-runtime#1.9.0-beta02",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Reduced the reference lifetime of values in the slot table between compositions. There are cases where a reference in a slot table could last a frame longer than necessary. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I49e7488186782a95cb62358292b2950b5730089b\">I49e74</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/418516940\">b/418516940</a>)</li>\n <li>Remove Kotlin mangle for Hot reload methods. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Ic56a3142f763b01a14b29e1cc20937622efd21eb\">Ic56a3</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/426871325\">b/426871325</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/3a0aa7a0552da83ba3994838f5db40d0d7a6196f..d578548e34459870db64b61d8788d83f2cf49f54/compose/runtime"
    },
    {
      "id": "compose-ui",
      "name": "Compose UI",
      "version": "1.9.0-beta02",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/compose-ui#1.9.0-beta02",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>API Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Changes companion object to experimental to match class. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I8452aa286a2aeb8f134bc5b6d776fef71b73e9d0\">I8452a</a>)</li>\n <li>Removed <code>isTrackFocusEnabled</code> experimental flag (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I003fd13c5c0c5a6062ab86d6d23a050bd4ab907e\">I003fd</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>When no <code>WindowInsets</code> enchroach on the content of the <code>ComposeView</code>, <code>WindowInsetsRulers</code> values are not provided. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I7122141fa51344acc2351299962ccde82468113e\">I71221</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/3a0aa7a0552da83ba3994838f5db40d0d7a6196f..d578548e34459870db64b61d8788d83f2cf49f54/compose/ui"
