      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>New Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Support Emoji 16.0 updates</li>\n <li>Add “emoji” suffix to the content description to make sure that we have a consistent accessibility behavior across all emoji picker apps.</li>\n</ul>",
